  },
  {
    "bookId": 4,
    "chapterId": 31,
    "verseId": 24,
    "text": "第七{H7637}日{H3117}，你們要洗{H3526}衣服{H899}，就為潔淨{H2891}，然後{H310}可以進{H935}營{H4264}。"
  },
  {
    "bookId": 4,
    "chapterId": 31,
    "verseId": 25,
    "text": "耶和華{H3068}曉諭{H559}摩西{H4872}說{H559}："
